fldesktop (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: fl-wm compositor, fl-panel, fl-launcher, fl-desktop,
    fl-greet, fl-term, fl-calc, fl-view, fl-files and fl-edit.
  * fl-settings, fl-osk (also built into fl-greet), fl-charmap, fl-mixer
    (PipeWire), fl-polkit-agent and fl-network (NetworkManager).
  * fl-notifyd, xdg-desktop-portal-fl, fl-printers (CUPS), fl-bluetooth
    (BlueZ), fl-packages (PackageKit), fl-flatpak and fl-firewall
    (firewalld); printer, Bluetooth and notification buttons in the panel.
  * fl-archive (libarchive) and fl-webcam (GStreamer); fl-video plays with
    GStreamer; fl-wm Alt+Tab window switcher; WireGuard and plugin VPNs in
    the network settings; tabs, menu bar and transparency in fl-term.
  * fl-web, a web browser on WPE WebKit. Drives in fl-files through UDisks2,
    automounting in the panel; battery, power modes and low battery
    warnings through UPower; Power and Removable Drives settings. Drag and
    drop onto the fl-files sidebar and the desktop; icon zoom.
  * Release tags set the version (packaging/version.sh).
  * fl-wm runs X11 programs through Xwayland (Steam, games, Wine, older
    Electron and Java programs).
  * Workspaces in fl-wm (Super+1..9, Super+Ctrl+arrows; ext-workspace-v1)
    and a workspace pager in fl-panel.
  * fl-screenshot is deprecated: use fl-snip --full or fl-snip --area.
    The wrapper stays for old key bindings and will be removed later.
  * Night light: fl-nightlight makes the screens warmer from sunset to
    sunrise (worked out from the time zone), at custom hours or always;
    settings in Displays, a toggle in the panel.

 -- Yjlion <yjlion@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0000
